OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 05 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1981FBBC One's globe symbol undergoes
OL,7,Fa colour change: the orange on blue
OL,8,Fscheme introduced in late-1974 is
OL,9,Fupdated to green on blue. Double line
OL,10,Flettering is adopted for the channel
OL,11,Fidentification on the ident, bringing
OL,12,Fit in line with the BBC Two symbol of
OL,13,Fthe time.
OL,14,
OL,15,FThe striped 'BBC 1' logo wasn't new
OL,16,Fthough - it had been used on BBC One
OL,17,Fprogramme slides and various
OL,18,Fpromotional trails since the mid-1970s;
OL,19,Fit also appeared on a number of the
OL,20,Fchannel's Christmas idents in the
OL,21,F1970s.
OL,22,
